{"id":533,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"英語・探究・平和を軸に学ぶ純心教育","feature_description":"東京純心女子は、実践的な英語力、探究を通じた論理的思考、いのちと平和に向き合う学びを三つの柱に据えます。図書館を拠点とする探究型学習やクリティカルシンキング、長崎研修を含む平和学習、海外研修などを通して、世界と自分との関わりを考えます。FYMでは授業と企業・大学・地域での体験をつなぎ、自分の進路や使命を主体的に探る時間を設けています。カトリックの価値観を基盤に他者と生きる力も育みます。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3388,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.t-junshin.ed.jp/education/study/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-07","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3389,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.t-junshin.ed.jp/education/study/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-07","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
